    "description": {
      "value": "<div class=\"rd__b  rd__b--2\"><p><span style=\"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\">以一個動作，你可以對距你30尺內的一名可見生物揮舞這張卡片。目標必須成功通過一次DC 17的魅力豁免，否則它會消失，被傳送到位於另一個存在位面的監獄中。1分鐘後，目標重新出現在離開前的空間。如果該空間被佔據，則它將出現在最近的未被佔據空間。這一特性一經使用，直到次日黎明之前無法再次使用。</span></p><p>As an action, you can brandish this card at one creature you can see within 30 feet of yourself. The target must succeed on a [[/save ability=cha dc=17]] saving throw, or it vanishes, transported to a prison on another plane of existence. After 1 minute, the target reappears in the space it left or in the nearest unoccupied space if that space is occupied. Once this property is used, it can't be used again until the next dawn.</p></div>",
